# Design System Components Checklist

A comprehensive list of UI elements and patterns for building a complete design system.

## **Foundations (Design Tokens)**
- Color palette (primary, secondary, semantic, neutral scales)
- Typography scale (font families, sizes, weights, line heights, letter spacing)
- Spacing scale (margin, padding, gap systems)
- Border radius scale
- Shadow/elevation scale
- Z-index scale
- Breakpoints (responsive design)
- Grid system
- Transitions/animations (duration, easing curves)
- Opacity scale

## **Typography Components**
- Headings (H1-H6)
- Body text (multiple sizes/weights)
- Labels
- Captions
- Code/monospace text
- Blockquotes
- Lists (ordered, unordered, definition)
- Links (with states: default, hover, active, visited, disabled)

## **Buttons & Actions**
- Primary/secondary/tertiary buttons
- Destructive/danger buttons
- Ghost/text buttons
- Icon buttons
- Button groups
- Split buttons
- Toggle buttons
- Floating action buttons (FAB)
- Loading buttons

## **Form Elements**
- Text inputs
- Textarea
- Number inputs
- Select/dropdown (single, multi-select)
- Autocomplete/combobox
- Radio buttons (individual and groups)
- Checkboxes (individual and groups)
- Toggle switches
- Sliders (single value, range)
- Date picker
- Time picker
- Date range picker
- Color picker
- File upload
- Search input
- Pin/OTP input
- Rich text editor
- Form validation states (error, warning, success)
- Helper text
- Field labels
- Required field indicators
- Character counters

