## Implementation Priority Recommendations

### Phase 1: Core Foundations
Start with design tokens, typography, colors, spacing, and the most frequently used components.

### Phase 2: Essential Components
Buttons, form elements, basic navigation, alerts, and data display components.

### Phase 3: Advanced Components
Complex patterns, specialized components, and mobile-specific elements.

### Phase 4: Documentation & Tooling
Component playground, usage guidelines, accessibility documentation, and developer resources.
